{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Architecture-oriented view of RAN, Open5GS packet core, IMS voice, and subscriber data. Component signals in this dashboard are derived from container logs.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    { "title": "Central log explorer", "url": "/grafana/d/openlain5g-logs/openlain5g-central-logs", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false },
    { "title": "Application runtime", "url": "/grafana/d/openlain5g-runtime/openlain5g-runtime", "type": "link", "targetBlank": false }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Dashboard --" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Network component view\n\nThe rows below group **container log activity** by the lab architecture: RAN (srsRAN / UERANSIM), Open5GS packet core, IMS voice (Kamailio and SIP services), and subscriber data. Prometheus currently measures the OpenLain5G backend and monitoring stack. Radio KPIs such as CQI, MCS, BLER, RF power, and per-subscriber throughput are not exported to Prometheus by the current profile images, so they are not represented here as live measurements."
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "openlain5g-loki" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\".*(enb|gnb|ue|ueransim|srsran).*\"}[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "RAN · srsRAN / UERANSIM", "queryType": "range", "refId": "A" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\"(nrf|amf|smf|upf|ausf|udm|udr|pcf|mme|hss|sgwc|sgwu|pgwc|pgwu|pcrf)\"}[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "Open5GS Core", "queryType": "range", "refId": "B" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\"(pcscf|icscf|scscf|rtpengine|smsc|sip-register|virtual-phones)\"}[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "IMS · Kamailio / SIP", "queryType": "range", "refId": "C" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\".*(mongo|database|provisioner|mysql|mariadb).*\"}[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "Subscriber / IMS data", "queryType": "range", "refId": "D" }
      ],
      "title": "Log activity by architecture layer",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "openlain5g-loki" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\".*(enb|gnb|ue|ueransim|srsran).*\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|critical)\"[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "RAN", "queryType": "range", "refId": "A" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\"(nrf|amf|smf|upf|ausf|udm|udr|pcf|mme|hss|sgwc|sgwu|pgwc|pgwu|pcrf)\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|critical)\"[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "Open5GS Core", "queryType": "range", "refId": "B" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\"(pcscf|icscf|scscf|rtpengine|smsc|sip-register|virtual-phones)\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|critical)\"[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "IMS voice", "queryType": "range", "refId": "C" },
        { "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\".*(mongo|database|provisioner|mysql|mariadb).*\"} |~ \"(?i)(error|fatal|critical)\"[$__interval]))", "legendFormat": "Subscriber / IMS data", "queryType": "range", "refId": "D" }
      ],
      "title": "Error and critical log events by layer",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "openlain5g-loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "dedupStrategy": "none", "enableLogDetails": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "showCommonLabels": true, "showLabels": true, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [{ "direction": "backward", "expr": "{job=\"openlain5g\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",service=~\".*(enb|gnb|ue|ueransim|srsran).*\"}", "maxLines": 1000, "queryType": "range", "refId": "A" }],
      "title": "RAN · srsRAN / UERANSIM",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "openlain5g-loki" },
